invariant: INV-57
file: handshake_message.h
catches: cnsa2_test
reason: the profile's external PSK runs SHA-256, the hash of no suite it
  offers, so the binder is 32 bytes and the server cannot check it. The
  mock server reads a 48-byte binder and both handshakes fail.

--- old
    (void)cfg;
    return SHA384_LEN;
--- new
    (void)cfg;
    return SHA256_LEN;
